Spec: Store listing

Purpose:
  Play Store listing texts, screenshots, feature graphics and the foreground-service demo video.

Owns:
  ./play
  ./ios

References:
  /store/README.md
  /docs/play-store.md
  /tool/tool.sdd

Must:
  The store name is `Retrail: Skate & Snow GPS` in both languages. The slogan is `Hinterlass deine Spur.` /
    `Leave your trail.`; the positioning line is "Skaten im Sommer, Boarden im Winter. Eine App für beides." /
    "Skate in summer, board in winter. One app for both." Skate stays first in every text, snow second.
  Snow words (snowboard, ski, Schnee, winter) enter the store texts only in a release that ships the
    snowboard and ski types in the app.
  Listing texts stay within Play limits: name `30`, short `80`, full description `4000` characters.
  App Store texts (`./ios/text`) stay within Apple limits: name `30`, subtitle `30`, keywords `100` (comma separated, no words from the name), promotional text `170`, description `4000` characters.
  Screenshots and feature graphics are rendered by `/tool/render_store_graphics.sh` from raw shots and HTML frames.
  App Store screenshots (`./ios`, 1320 x 2868) are rendered by `/tool/render_ios_store_graphics.sh` from the Simulator shots of `/tool/ios_screenshots.sh`.
  A visible UI change in a screenshotted screen gets new screenshots before the next production release.
